window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b><i>He’s cruel, relentless, and living down the hall. Now he knows her secret and he’s not letting go.</i></b><br><br><b>Tessa</b><br>I had one plan. Stay invisible, count the days, and keep my body’s humiliating condition under wraps. But Riven makes that impossible. He’s the school’s bad boy, my new stepbrother, and the bully who never misses a chance to watch me unravel. His taunts cut deep, but it’s his eyes that see too much. He found out what I leak, and instead of being disgusted, he’s obsessed. Now every glance, every brush of contact, turns crueler, sharper, and more addictive. I hate him. I crave him. And I’m falling apart.<br><br><b>Riven</b><br>She hides under hoodies and silence like that’s enough to keep me out. But Tessa’s body gives her away. I see how she clenches when I’m near. I see how she reacts when I mock her. I know her secret now, the one that makes her squirm and flush and ache. She thinks she can survive me, but she’s already mine. I’ll push her, break her, make her leak for me. And when she finally begs, it won’t be out of fear. It’ll be because she wants it.<br><br>🔥 Bully Romance 🖤 Stepbrother Enemies 💦 Lactation Kink 🔥 Cruel Obsession 💔 Forced Proximity 😈 Humiliation and Heat 🔗 She Leaks, He Owns It 🥵 Dark Domestic Tension 🌙 Forbidden and Twisted 🧨 He Sees What She Hides<br>"; 
